eppi8gfvh","title":"OpenAI称GPT-6 Astra一周内自主设计硬件设备","summary":"OpenAI的硬件团队通过GPT-6 Astra一周内完成了一个支持用户与Codex交互的硬件设备设计，包含电路板布局和固件开发。该设备原型在制造过程中因未考虑生产限制进行了多次迭代。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/openai-says-gpt-6-astra-designed-a-hardware-device-from-scratch-in-under-a-week/","publishedAt":"2026-11-03T20:15:45.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true}]},{"label":"行业动态","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a89defb5d85af0eb3b8ae44cc4a4d5bbe7150da8ad56480e7df423a25f1634d.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp 96w","itemId":"r5d6bj339sjvcyyuju0tffwue","title":"Google允许学校禁用AI工具，但需牺牲搜索服务","summary":"Google宣布明年将默认禁用K-12学生的AI工具，除非学校管理员主动启用。该调整涉及Gemini、NotebookLM等AI产品与Google Search的深度整合，学校若全面禁用AI将无法使用搜索服务。此次变化同步推出面向学校的Guided Learning工具，旨在通过链式推理等机制提升学习深度而非直接提供答案。","sourceName":"TechCrunch · AI","sourceUrl":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/03/google-will-let-schools-disable-its-ai-tools-but-not-without-sacrificing-search/","publishedAt":"2026-11-03T16:30:34.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"related":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/d8005acd58268e7cd7fda60d43e180921e5eb3ac716974f75571ef865eaf42e1.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp 96w","itemId":"lwosxo0dvvwuqu3dqjptj4mj7","title":"Google关闭学校搜索功能，除非管理员启用AI工具","summary":null,"sourceName":"The Verge · AI","sourceUrl":"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1025411/google-turn-off-search-ai-features","publishedAt":"2026-11-03T17:00:04.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true}]},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":"p58fmolhw6i68y6meukln8fkc","title":"俄罗斯加速部署地下数据中心应对乌克兰无人机打击",