/data/media/3a89defb5d85af0eb3b8ae44cc4a4d5bbe7150da8ad56480e7df423a25f1634d.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp 96w","itemId":"pltdhisikbhb2pebkx2ssjb1m","title":"苹果将AI伴侣及交友应用年龄限制提升至18岁以上","summary":"苹果宣布从11月16日起要求所有提供交友或AI伴侣功能的App必须标注18+评级。该政策特别影响Character.AI、Replika等允许创建恋爱型AI伴侣的应用，要求开发者新增内容描述。数据显示全球AI伴侣类应用累计下载量达220 million次，同时新规要求共享用户实时位置的应用明确标注隐私条款。","sourceName":"TechCrunch · AI","sourceUrl":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/03/apple-restricts-dating-apps-and-ai-companions-to-users-18-and-up/","publishedAt":"2026-11-03T15:38:27.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a89defb5d85af0eb3b8ae44cc4a4d5bbe7150da8ad56480e7df423a25f1634d.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp 96w","itemId":"fkw99jjl96q90aokmw93cuhq9","title":"Anthropic计算成本占比攀升至58% 暗示基础设施依赖加剧","summary":"Anthropic最新季度计算成本占比达58% 营收同比增长近50%但运营亏损扩大。数据显示其单季计算支出达10亿美元（含5亿美元短期承诺采购成本显著高于长期合约），主要依赖SpaceX（月费1.25亿美元）、Nscale等新云服务商。","sourceName":"TechCrunch · AI","sourceUrl":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/03/anthropic-is-still-grappling-with-the-economics-of-compute/","publishedAt":"2026-11-03T17:07:01.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"qfdayb8txr8nnmvtspg15jyh4","title":"Gen Digital 如何利用 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Web Search 重构诺顿AI新闻引擎","summary":"Gen Digital 通过 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Web Search 重构诺顿AI新闻引擎，实现实时、个性化的行业动态追踪。该引擎采用事件驱动架构，结合AWS Nova Lite和Bedrock AgentCore Web Search，通过用户目标、近期活动及交互模式生成搜索查询，实时获取权威来源数据并验证时效性。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-gen-digital-built-norton-revamps-ai-curated-news-engine-with-amazon-bedrock-agentcore-web-search/","publishedAt":"2026-11-03T16:43:20.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/8fa81ac2ff0525230e8911420f78dddc59d19d1503d8084f830acaedebb138ee.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp 96w","itemId":"qknlmy5dwd2c21rkhsz0r5lma","title":"斯坦福研究：LLM发展速度远超现有论文解释能力","summary":"斯坦福研究显示，44%的广泛引用的LLM相关结论已过时，模型性能差异显著。测试发现Qwen3.7-Flash仍存在69%的引用伪造问题，Claude Sonnet 5.5在两步推理任务中仍有10%错误率。研究建议论文需标注具体模型版本和日期，并开源测试代码以支持后续验证。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/rapid-llm-development-is-outrunning-the-research-meant-to-explain-it-study-finds/","publishedAt":"2026-11-03T19:41:43.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f87867cb32a9719100390bc34297eb3c792ddbaa2b812bed160741e13b1c45c2.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/954587e32bfcc94b282e8b0ff51ea7bfa887b1c3bb0610d2a3304a6ef3f65294.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f87867cb32a9719100390bc34297eb3c792ddbaa2b812bed160741e13b1c45c2.webp 96w","itemId":"rfdop6ilthv6o1i4wbqnt2il8","title":"NVIDIA物理与智能体AI助力全球城市构建AI服务","summary":"NVIDIA与合作伙伴推动物理AI和智能体技术在城市服务中的应用。马德里数字项目通过1MillionBot整合开源模型与NVIDIA Nemotron，覆盖150+部署；ITMAX在马来西亚使用SamurAI V2 vision agents管理17000+摄像头，结合TeraSim仿真平台将高峰时段通行时间缩短26%。","sourceName":"NVIDIA Blog","sourceUrl":"https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/cities-physical-agentic-ai-applications/","publishedAt":"2026-11-03T07:00:12.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a