化高级顾问，旨在加强政府合作与军事AI应用。Driscoll曾主导陆军AI现代化项目，包括预算、物流和战术模型部署。此举正值OpenAI与五角大楼达成机密网络部署协议，而Anthropic因拒绝监控条款被军方禁用。Driscoll在国会两党间有广泛人脉，可能影响未来AI国防政策制定。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/openai-hires-ex-army-secretary-gaining-bipartisan-reach-just-as-midterms-loom/","publishedAt":"2026-11-03T15:03:02.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp 96w","itemId":"tbnd4kqmnjdtxofjn0ak8daek","title":"Amazon Quick 教程：如何整合结构化与非结构化数据","summary":"通过Amazon Quick，用户可在一个工作空间中整合结构化数据（如CSV）与非结构化数据（如PDF文档），并创建定制聊天代理进行跨类型查询。","sourceName":"AWS Machine Learning Blog","sourceUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/bring-structured-and-unstructured-data-together-with-amazon-quick/","publishedAt":"2026-11-03T16:49:29.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true}],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalEvents":12,"sourcesCount":8,"modelsReleased":0,"firstPartyEvents":5},"readingMinutes":4,"prev":"2026-11-03","next":"2026-11-05"}